        'rawContent': "{{Company Information|\n|name = Consolidated Spaceworks\n|industry = Aerospace and Defense\n|founded = [[2009]]\n|headquarters = Headquarters in Argyre Planitia, [[Mars]]\n|key_people = Chief Executive Officer\n|products = Munitions, transport aircraft, fighter aircraft, radar, satellites, launch vehicles, [[Orion Spacecraft]], [[Interstellar Exploration Vehicle]], numerous others\n}}\n\n'''Consolidated Spaceworks''' is a leading interstellar aerospace manufacturer and advanced technology company formed in [[2009]] by the merger of Lockheed Martin with Mikoyan-Gurevich and BAE Systems. It was headquartered in Bethesda, Maryland until the [[Mars]] colony was opened for private development in [[2025]]. Consolidated Spaceworks moved its headquarters to the colony in order to promote civilian space flight.\n\nConsolidated Spaceworks is the [[Sol System]]'s largest air and space developer. Throughout its history, 90% of Consolidated Spaceworks' revenues came from the [[United Earth Alliance]].\n\n[[Category:Companies]]\n[[Category:Corporations]]"
