        'rawContent': "{{Company Information|\n|name = Blasius állam-Nehézipar\n|headquarters = Headquarters in XX\n|key_people = Chief Executive Officer\n}}\n\n'''Blazton Heavy Industries''' is the common bond of all of the [[Sirius Families]]. Founded two generations ago by [[Gregor Blazton I|Gregor Blazton]], and now run by his grandson [[Gregor Blazton III]], the heavy industrial conglomerate has its hands in mining and manufacturing interests throughout [[Terran]] space.\n\n\n==History==\nXX\n\n==Corporate governance==\nxx\n\n==Divisions==\n\n===Aeronautics===\n*xx\n\n===Electronic Systems===\n*xx\n\n===Information Systems & Global Services===\n*xx\n\n===Space Systems===\n*xx\n\n===Security===\nBlazton Heavy Industries operates a private security firm that qualifies as a small private military. It into three branches:\n*[[Blazton Territorial Naval Forces|Territorial Naval Forces]]\n*[[Blazton Territorial Planetary Security Forces|Territorial Planetary Security Forces]]\n*[[Blazton Territorial Air Forces|Territorial Air Forces]]\n\n===Others===\n*xx\n\n===Joint Ventures===\n*XX\n\n[[Category:Blazton_Heavy_Industries]]\n[[Category:Companies]]\n[[Category:Sirius_Families]]\n[[Category:Sirius Families]]\n[[Category:Blazton Heavy Industries]]\n[[Category:Corporations]]"
