        'rawContent': '{{Company Information|\n|name = Mesarbauer\n|image = [[Image:Mb-logo.png|200px]]\n|caption = Mesarbauer Logo (2335 - present)\n|industry = Warship, Aerospace, Communication\n|founded = 2132\n|headquarters = Headquarters in [[Brünshelm]], [[Mesar#Willim|Willim]]\n|key_people = Geschaftsführer [[Vincent Hund von Eberhart]]\n|products = Warships, fighter aircraft, transport vessels, satellites.\n|revenue = [[Likvada|IJL]] £ 210.21 Billion\n|employees = 310,000\n}}\n\n[[Image:Mesarbauer Strauss.png|thumb|right|Mesarbauer Logo (2325 - 2335)]]\n[[Image:MesarbauerLogo.png|thumb|right|Mesarbauer Logo (2132 - 2325)]]\n\n==History==\nMesarbauer was founded by Geschaftsführer [[Edmond Baumgartner]], Lord of the Baumgartner Clan, Protector of the Clans Economy in [[2132]] using almost the entire treasury of the fledgling clans.  [[Edmond Baumgartner|Edmond]] was convinced that a strong navy would be vital to defeating the [[Anderung]], so he bet heavily in the company.  [[Edmond Baumgartner|Edmond]] established Mesarbauer so that the [[Clan Lord|Tischler]] Clan was the sole owners of Mesarbauer.  However, in [[2265]], the [[United Mesarthrim Clans]], as a whole, became the majority owners of shares in Mesarbauer, making it the first national state construction organisation.  During the [[Mesarthrim Civil War]], [[Strauss Energie]] bargained for all Mesarbauer stock when they called in their loans they made to the [[United Mesarthrim Clans]] government.  The Geschaftsführer of [[Strauss Energie]] sold the majority of shares in Mesarbauer to [[William Camp]], in exchange for exclusive power distribution rights on [[Mesar]] under the [[United Centusi States]].  Mesarbauer came under criticism just prior to the [[Tempest War]] from the [[Ikronin Jurekön]] for what they called an illegal interstellar monopoly.  However, once the [[Tempest War]] began, the charges were dropped since the [[United Centusi States]] and [[Ikronin Jurekön]] were now officially at war.  During the [[Tempest War|war]] [[William Camp]] nationalised all [[Mesarthrim]] Corporations.  Mesarbauer absorbed all remaining non-[[Auellal League|Auellal]] [[Fireline Industries]] assets were freed from [[Strauss Energie]].\n\n==Corporate governance==\nMesarbauer is currently a priatley ownerd company.  Mesarbaur is owned by [[William Camp]], Lord of the [[Clan Lords|Tischler]] Clan, and [[Chancellor]] of the [[United Centusi States]].\n\n==Divisions==\nxx\n\n===Aeronautics===\n[[Image:Mesarbauer-fd.png|thumb|300px|right|Mesarbauer Fighter Division.]]\n\n===Transport Lines===\n[[Image:Mesarbauer-TL.png|thumb|300px|right|Mesarbauer Warship Division.]]\n\n===Warship Development Center===\n[[Image:Mesarbauer-wd.png|thumb|300px|right|Mesarbauer Warship Division.]]\n\n===Satellites===\n[[Image:Mesarbauer-Satellites.png|thumb|300px|right|Mesarbauer Warship Division.]]\n\n===Joint Ventures===\n*XX\n\n[[Category:Companies]]\n[[Category:Mesarbauer]]\n[[Category:Corporations]]'
