        'rawContent': "{{Company Information|\n|name = Alexi-Wrought Airworks\n|image = [[Image:alexi-wrought-logo.png|200px]]\n|caption = Alexi-Wrought Logo.\n|industry = Aerospace\n|founded = August 19, [[2267]]\n|headquarters = Headquarters in [[Rio de Andes]], [[Ah Kin]], [[Alpha Centauri System]]\n|key_people = [[Thomas deGraff]]\n|products = [[F-4 Raven]]\n}}\n\n'''Alexi-Wrought Airworks''' - Alexi-Wrought Airworks is an aerospace company formed from the merger of Alexi Synthetics and Wrought Aerospace Engineering in [[2267]]. Its primary market was civilian commerical and industrial aircraft and composites for the latter half of the [[23rd Century]].\n\nIn the early [[24th Century]], the company was chosen by the [[Onyx Empire]] to act as their primary provider of [[:Category:Aircraft|aircraft]] during the military buildup leading up to the [[Second Exodus War]].\n\n[[Category:Companies]]\n[[Category:Corporations]]"
