        'images': {
            'AlliedBody-ArmorLogo.png': {
                'legacy': 'assets/codex/AlliedBody-ArmorLogo.png',
                'alt': 'AlliedBody-ArmorLogo'
            }
        },
        'rawContent': "{{Company Information|\n|name = Allied Body-Armor\n|image = [[Image:AlliedBody-ArmorLogo.png|200px]]\n|caption = Allied Body-Armor Logo.\n|industry = Composites and textiles\n|headquarters = Headquartered on [[Albanus]]\n|products = Body Armor\n}}\n\n'''Allied Body Armor''', based on [[Albanus]], designs and engineers boron-nitride and other composites into armor and clothing for military and police. They also have a distribution center for private security and private citizens, though their main market is the military.\n\nAllied Body Armor is also famous for its \"VIProtector\" line of second-chance body armor, designed to be worn under formal wear for ambassadors, politicians, CEOs, and other VIPs.\n\n[[Category:Companies]]\n[[Category:Corporations]]"
