        'rawContent': "{{Company Information|\n|name = Mesar Schnittstelle Gruppe\n|image = [[Image:Mesar-Schnittstelle-Gruppe_Logo.png|200px]]\n|caption = Mesar Schnittstelle Gruppe Logo.\n|industry = Software, Artificial Intelligence, Mesarthrim User Interface\n|founded = 2260\n|headquarters = Headquarters in Cabletown, [[Mesar]]\n|key_people = CEO Garret von Kelug, CTO Rickard Eberhart, CRO Jorge Hammil von Dietrich\n|products = Pendelbus v13.2, Nachtpferd dotMIL, Eins v.6\n|revenue = [[Likvada|IJL]] £ 61 Billion\n|employees = 45,000\n}}\n\n'''Mesar Schnittstelle Gruppe''' - Based in Cabletown Mesar. Designs [[Pendelbus]] for Civillian [[Zewischenablage]] Computers and Military [[Nachtpferd]] Hardware.  They are the number one software developer on Mesar. Following the adoption of the [[Cinead Accords]], MSG began work on Mesarthrim built [[Self-Aware Entities]] for their warships.\n\n==History==\nXX\n\n==Corporate governance==\nxx\n\n==Divisions==\n\nxx\n\n===Aeronautics===\n*xx\n\n===Electronic Systems===\n*xx\n\n===Information Systems & Global Services===\n*xx\n\n===Space Systems===\n*xx\n\n===Warship Development Center===\n*XX\n\n===Security===\n*XX\n\n===Others===\n*xx\n\n===Joint Ventures===\n*XX\n\n[[Category:Companies]]\n[[Category:Mesar_Schnittstelle_Gruppe]]\n[[Category:Mesar Schnittstelle Gruppe]]\n[[Category:Corporations]]"
