        'rawContent': "{{Company Information|\n|name = Centusi Cargo\n|image = [[Image:CCC.png|200px]]\n|caption = Centusi Cargo & Carriers\n|industry = Aerospace\n|founded = [[2265]]\n|headquarters = Headquarters in Homemakers Field, [[Mesar]]\n|key_people = Wilfred Gilbert\n|products = [[Pegasus Dropship]], [[Banshee Class Carrier|Banshee Class Carrier]]\n|revenue = [[Likvada|IJL]] £ 112.55 Billion\n|employees = 45,000\n}}\n\n'''Centusi Cargo & Containers''' - Based in Homemakers Field on [[Mesar]]. Designs aerospace craft, transport craft, and cargo haulers, civilian & military.\n\n\n==Joint Ventures==\n*[[2322]] - Under Mesarthim Clan Occupational Government, [[Banshee Class Carrier]] co-developed with [[Northern Star]]. After the start of the [[Tempest War]] Northern Star removed itself from the project.\n\n[[Category:Companies]]\n[[Category:Corporations]]"
